OL,3,GNEWSAResidents say planned road changes
OL,4,A'a nightmare'
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents say council plans to make
OL,7,Fmajor changes to roads and transport
OL,8,Facross busy Sheffield neighbourhoods
OL,9,Fwill be "devastating" and "a
OL,10,Fnightmare".
OL,12,FSheffield City Council is consulting on
OL,13,Fpotential widespread highway changes,
OL,14,Fwhich would affect Hillsborough,
OL,15,FMiddlewood, Malin Bridge, Stannington
OL,16,Fand Walkley.
OL,18,FMore than 1,600 residents and
OL,19,Fbusinesses have signed a petition
OL,20,Fagainst the changes, which include
OL,21,Fextending the hours of an existing bus
OL,22,Fand tram gate.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
