OL,3,GNEWSAResidents say planned road changes
OL,4,A'a nightmare'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council has said the proposals will
OL,7,Fimprove reliability and journey times
OL,8,Ffor buses and trams to allow more
OL,9,Fpeople to use public transport and
OL,10,F"free up space on our roads for people
OL,11,Fwho need to drive".
